                        <h4 style="color: var(--ent-text-main); font-weight: 600;">No tickets found</h4>
                        <p style="color: var(--ent-text-muted);">You haven't submitted any inquiries yet.</p>
                        <a href="/tech-packages" class="ent-btn-secondary mt-3" style="display: inline-block; text-decoration: none;">Explore Packages</a>
